{
  "name": "13 · Queue Wait Alert (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 13 · Queue Wait Alert\nFor any walk-in business with a queue (salon, clinic, service centre, bakery orders, repair counter). Staff press **Next customer** → the customer who is next and the one 2 away get a WhatsApp, so people wait outside or at home, not at your counter.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup).\n2. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Tokens**: Date (yyyy-mm-dd), Token, Name, Phone, Service, Status. Add each walk-in with a token number.\n3. The button: POST {\"token\": 12} to this webhook URL from a phone shortcut, tablet or an n8n form.\n\nNo AI needed here: fixed, polite messages.",
        "height": 574,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "632405f9-a737-4f59-bbe5-e971cf9d030f",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
